window.products.push({"id":458062,"name":"BDF BLKT Window Film Blackout Privacy (48in X 49ft)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710Uh9AMxQL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Windows are a vital part of humanity that animates life and gives room to breathe. It is also a pathway into one¡¯s individuality, or a space of contemplation, a rest area from ordinary routine. Therefore, the purposes of neatly arranged and appropriately adhered window films are many. A sheet of well installed decorative window film may provide you with opportunities to express your personality and creativity, and/or offer you privacy from scenes and distractions that may otherwise be overwhelming. The Black Out Decorative Window Film is designed to ensure almost 100% opacity and ideal for applications that require absolute privacy or view shielding. Great for office glass partitions, and conference or study room windows. The film¡¯s complete black tint enhances your concentration and gathers your focus. It is chic; it is modern; it is smart. Durable and scratch resistant.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710Uh9AMxQL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Buydecorativefilm","source_asin":"B08BTP5KC4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-458062","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BTP5KC4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BTP5KC4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":458063,"name":"Vinod Black Pearl Hard Anodised Handi – Stainless Steel Lid – Medium Size – 5 Liters (5.2 Quarts) – Suitable For Biryani, Pulao, Gravy –Aluminum Pot -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":50.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51r5e0EWPwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🍲BRILLIANT KADHAI: This 3.25mm Black Pearl Hard Anodised Handi from Vinod is created with 100% virgin aluminum, and it's got an incredible design that you're going to love. The amazing buildup is created for even heat distribution, which lets your food get the best warmth - and better flavor! Using prime-quality materials, you're getting a sturdy product that lasts for years - because we want the quality of your meals to be consistent no matter what. 🌟5-STAR RATING: Perfect for excellent cuisines, the Handi Pot maintains a 5-star anodized body which is 7x stronger than steel to ensure you get a streamlined cooking experience With its belly shape, this Handi gives you the most natural flavor to your food while also ensuring that you can cook faster because of its deep bottom, which is perfect for making meals such as Biryani or Pulav. The Ergonomically riveted handles give you greater control, giving you more comfort when making dishes. 🪄INCREDIBLY USEFUL: Bolstering a Hard Anodized Body the Vinod Handi Pot comes in a brilliant design that offers incredible features. Designed to offer about 5 Liters(5.2 Quarts) of cooking capacity and a belly-shaped bottom that is applicable in cooking exquisite delicacies like biryani, pulav, and other aromatic curries. The pot comes layered with a high-quality stainless steel lid which helps the user feel their food as it absorbs all the warmth, making for the most delectable cuisine💚 💯MULTIPLE VARIATIONS FOR YOU TO CHOOSE: Vinod Cookware Hard Anodized Handi Collection provides you with a plethora of options for you to choose from. Ranging from a 2 Liters(Mini) Capacity and going all the way up to 6.5 Liters(Large), there is freedom of choice and assuring there is something for everyone to choose. Enjoy Scratch Resistant and Metal Spoon Friendly Handi, with each providing you with an amazing satisfaction that’ll surely last for a long time to come. 🤝COMES WITH A PROMISE: We at Vinod Cookware take customer experience and contentment extremely seriously. We strive in providing the highest quality of products to our customers. In the unlikely event of any issues, please feel free to contact us, we will do all we can to assist you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51r5e0EWPwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VINOD","source_asin":"B08L4YSY1X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-458063","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L4YSY1X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L4YSY1X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
