window.products.push({"id":458152,"name":"AmazerBath Shower Squeegee, Stainless Steel Glass Window Squeegee with Detachable 14 Inch Blade 6.4 Inch Longer Handle for Shower Doors Windows Kitche","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TGOsd9D8L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Longer and good grip handle - The 6.4 inch handle is longer than typical shower squeegees that are only 5.5 inches. High quality stainless steel provides a comfortable, sleek grip for smooth textures. Silicone material blade - Unlike other stiff PVC material blades, this bathroom squeegee adopts a soft and flexible silicone material. Our squeegee provides streak-free, quiet, and smooth swipes and the attached replacement silicone blade provides much more convenience to you for a longer life. Multi-purpose - The shower squeegee can clean tiles, shower doors, mirrors, windows, car glasses, tabletops, hand washing sinks, and house windows. It efficiently removes water spots, soap scum, and other dirt. Adhesive hooks - No drill, no punch required for installation. Tear off the adhesive backing and press the hook firmly onto a clean, dry, and smooth wall surface. The hook should be placed in a location with room to hang the shower squeegee. The adhesive squeegee holder is powerful enough to bear a heavy squeegee for a longer time than a small suction cup holder. There is no need to worry about it falling off. Stainless steel - Rust-resistant and durable. This shower squeegee is made of high quality stainless steel for long-lasting use, even in wet conditions. The design is comfortable and easy to grip, and won't be slippery or awkward while using. One extra silicone blade is included in case you damage the original blade. Detach the small screw to replace the blade and tighten fully to secure the new blade.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TGOsd9D8L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AmazerBath","source_asin":"B07YSDMP65","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-458152","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YSDMP65","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YSDMP65","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
