window.products.push({"id":458199,"name":"HMYHUM Acrylic Side Table/End Table for Living Room, Small Bedside Table/Nightstand for Bedroom, Home Accent Table, 3-Tier, 30 lbs Load, 15.7\" L x 11.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ry0l1dQNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High Quality Modern Acrylic Style: Made of 100% acrylic that is smooth, high-strength, lightweight, eco-friendly and durable, easy to clean. Perfect Space Saver: Size 15.7\" L x 11.8\" W x 23\" H, space saving 3 tiers design enhances storage capacity without taking up a lot of floor space. Utilitarian Structure: With acrylic boards, can hold up to 30 lbs per level, stable and durable. The edges are structured smoothly round for your utmost safety. Easy to Assemble: You can assemble the product in a short time, just need to use a Phillips screwdriver to install. Multifunctional Acrylic Table: Suitable for your living room, bedroom, bathroom or foyer. Used as a small end table, coffee table, bedside table, couch table, or as a decorative table.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ry0l1dQNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HMYHUM","source_asin":"B0B73CXKF2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-458199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B73CXKF2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B73CXKF2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":458200,"name":"Babiey 12 pcs Artificial White Roses Silk Roses with Stems Fake Blossom Flowers for Home Wedding Party Decoration(Off White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ri4TiRixL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Babiey 12pcs Artificial Roses in Bulk Single Long Stem Silk Blossom Flower forfor DIY Wedding Bouquets Centerpieces Bridal Shower Party Home Decor Specifications: Color: Red/Off White/Green/Champagne Pink/Light Champagne/Gradient purple Package:12 Single Roses in a Pack Widely Useage:Floral Arrangements/Home Decoration/Table Centerpieces/Wedding Bridal Bouquet/Party Decoration Warm Tips: The flowers head may become slightly compressed in transit, but can easily be returned to their correct shape. Please don’t worry, after receiving the items, use a blow dryer on them to flatten the petals and open them up, it only took a few minutes to refresh them.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ri4TiRixL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Babiey","source_asin":"B099RLBK1Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-458200","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099RLBK1Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099RLBK1Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":458201,"name":"Scanpan CTX 13-Piece Deluxe Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SRlRsGzkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Operating the Can Opener Step1 - Place the Can Opener on top of the can with its rim positioned in the groove between the Cutter and the Drive Wheel Step2 - With the can on a flat surface, press the Button for about one second and release, then the Can Opener will start cutting the side of the can Step3 - When the cutting has completed, press the button immediately to reverse the cutter Step4 - Make sure that the cutter resets to the start position and the motor stops. Then, lift the can opener off the can Trouble Shooting 1. If batteries are depleted, the can may not be released by pressing the button. Slide back the Battery Door and replace 2 AA batteries. The Can Opener should continue the cutting. Remember to replace the battery. 2. Cans with heavy seams and uneven rims may stall the Can Opener. If this happens, follow above procedure to release the can. 3. If the can is get stucked, please press the white button on the top of the can opener. Note: 1) Use 2 new batteries ( High quality AA batteries), cheaper less quality new batteries are inadequate and may not preform as necessary. 2) After completely revolving around the can and cutting the edge, the can will still appear to be sealed. After prying up the lid will it be evident that the can and its resealable lid are detached. 15) Do not lift or forcefully remove the can opener from the can while it is operational. Forceful removal can cause damage to the knife-edge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SRlRsGzkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scanpan","source_asin":"B00M4P0JL4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-458201","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00M4P0JL4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00M4P0JL4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":458202,"name":"Spoon Rest For Kitchen Counter, Pack of 4 BPA-Free and Food Grade Silicone Spoon Holder – Smooth Surface – Classy Look – Spoon Holder for Stove Top – ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mhciHofGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍴Premium Quality: This functional spoon rest is made using high-quality and food-grade silicone material to make it your long-lasting cooking partner. The spoon rest for kitchen counter can resist up to 500° F, and you can put your hot spoon on it right from the boiling broth. The flexible spoon holder will not break easily, no matter how many times it falls. 🍴Safe and Functional: Made from BPA free material, this spoon holder for stove top is free from all types of harmful chemicals that can toxicate your food items. The smooth designed, non-skid spatula holder is suitable for cooking spoons as well as other cooking gadgets like table cutlery, brush, utensil, etc. Hang it up on the spoon rack for storing conveniently. 🍴Simple But Stylish: The modern look of this silicone spoon rest enhances the grace of your kitchen interior. Available in decent colors, this stove spoon holder is a simple but very classy item that helps you to keep your countertop clean of spoon stains, adding elegance to your kitchen counter decor. The plain look of the spoon rest for stove top integrates easily into any interior. 🍴Ideal Size: The lightweight kitchen utensil holder is just the right size that can easily accommodate large, medium, or small spoons. You can use the silicone spoon holder for cooking spoons, spatulas, brushes, rice spoon, soup spoon, stirrer, wooden spoon, tongs, ladle, slotted spoon, risotto, or whatever you want. The perfect shape and design will keep your spoon balanced. 🍴Easy Clean: The smooth surfaced kitchen spoon holder is so easy to clean that you will find it a blessing to be in your kitchen. The dishwasher safe spoon carrier doesn't take much time of yours. Make sure to wash them every time after cooking, or the particles or stains from the cooking spoon might remain on then, causing contamination of the food you cook next time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mhciHofGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QiuYe","source_asin":"B08MBSX9DT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-458202","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MBSX9DT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MBSX9DT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
