window.products.push({"id":458214,"name":"Cord Organizer for Appliances 4 Pcs Cord Wrappers for Kitchen Appliances with Super Sticky Adhesive for Small Home Appliances Cord Keeper on Stand Mix","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uVQHHoRCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Multi-functional upgrade design]: Through customer experience, we will upgrade the cord organizer in depth. It solves the problems that the winder is not sticky enough, easy to fall off and the use surface is too single. The cord organizer has super viscosity and can be used in electric appliances with curved surfaces. [High-quality safety materials]: Our cord organizer is made of high-quality silica gel, durable and not easy to deform. Silicone resin is also resistant to high temperature, and has strong electrical insulation. Butterfly appearance, beautiful and durable. [Easy to install]: The wires of household appliances are left disorderly for a long time, which can easily damage the wires or be tripped by the elderly and children. This is a small wire trimmer that allows you to easily wrap wires with one hand. All your kitchen equipment wiring will be well organized and expanded. Help you solve the problem of line confusion. [Wide compatibility]: It is not only applicable to various kitchen equipment, such as coffee machine, air fryer, blender, pressure cooker, toaster, juicer and other kitchen appliances. It can also be used to fix the wires of computers and mobile phones. It can even be used to hang daily necessities and tidy bathroom wires. [Good helper for home kitchen]: Have you been trying to tidy up the messy kitchen electrical power cord? A wire clip gadget for wired equipment on the kitchen counter, which is compatible with glass, ceramic, wood, plastic, metal, ceramic tile, wallpaper and leather surfaces. Send it to your mother, girlfriend, wife or anyone who needs to cook in the kitchen frequently to express your gratitude and love!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uVQHHoRCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oudizz","source_asin":"B0BVZB8D4Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-458214","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVZB8D4Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVZB8D4Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
