window.products.push({"id":458388,"name":"Ultra Soft & Exquisitely Smooth Genuine 100% Plush Cotton 1200 Thread Count Sheet Set, Lavish Sateen Solid, Deep Pockets (18\" Pockets), 5 Piece Split ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":116.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31HxTaf6UmL._AC_.jpg","description":"These luxurious 1200 count Egyptian linens are some of the most sought after sheets for the discerning Plush Cotton connoisseur. Discover why 1200 Count Plush Cotton sheets are sought after by so many. What is the secret to Plush Cotton? Plush Cotton fibers are twice as long as a standard cotton fiber. A longer fibers creates a finer spun yarn. The longer fiber gives 1200 count Plush Cotton sheets their signature drape and softness. Long staple, 100% Plush Cotton yarns are woven into this sumptuous fabric and then double-finished to create the ultimate in soft sheets, pillowcases, duvet covers, pillow shams and accessories.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31HxTaf6UmL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elegant Bedding","source_asin":"B00TBW6YLW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-458388","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00TBW6YLW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00TBW6YLW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
