window.products.push({"id":458534,"name":"Filtration Group 10863 3-Ply Ring Panel Air Filter, Synthetic Polyester Media, Pink/White, 6 MERV, 16\" Height x 16\" Width x 1\" Depth (Case of 24)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613L8avkS+L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Filtration Group's 3-Ply Polyester Panel filters incorporate three distinct filter layers permanently heat-sealed around a galvanized , 9-gauge internal wire frame. The first layer acts as a high-porosity impingement filter, the second a high-density interceptor and the third as a durable strainer to prevent unloading or streaming. A non-migrating tackifier between the second and third laminates assures positive filter-cake build up. This filter achieves a high level of efficiency on a wide range of particle sizes. Since there is no external support struture necessary, all of the media surface is exposed to the air stream. The Filtration Group 3-Ply filters may exceed the performance and service life of rigid, pleated filters. They offer the additional advantage of being self-gasketing, friction-fit frames that can often eliminate the need for extra mounting hardware. When used as pre-filters, these filters will add substantially to the life of more expensive high efficiency filters.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613L8avkS+L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Filtration Group","source_asin":"B00BAR2U82","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-458534","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BAR2U82","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BAR2U82","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
