window.products.push({"id":458568,"name":"Bellemave 7-Piece Dining Table Set Wood Rectangular Extendable Dining Table and 6 Chairs Rustic Dining Set for 6 People Ideal for Kitchen, Dinning Roo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":653.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rkTx7r7cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brighten a room with this Bellemave 7 Piece Dining Table Set in farmhouse gray hues. The solid wood tabletop and chairs are sturdy with a distressed finish for rustic charm. With six chairs, you'll have plenty of room for brunch and lunch with friends and family. Assembly required. Dimensions & Weight: Product Dimensions & Weight: Collapsed table: 58\"L x 36”W x 30”HExtended table: 76”L x 36”W x 30”H, 101 LBSChair: 17.1”L x 21.8”W x 37.6”H, 14.4LBS/piecePackage Dimensions & Weight: Package 1: 65”L x 41”W x 7”H, 119.05 LBSPackage 2: 40”L x 25”W x 19”H, 103.62 LBSWeight Capacity: Table: 300 LBSChair: 250 LBS Specifications: Product Name: Dining Table SetColor: Gray / EspressoMaterial: Tabletop—MDF veneer acaciaLegs—rubber woodFrame—poplar woodChair top—rubber wood+foam+fabricLegs—rubber woodThickness: Tabletop: 1.4inLeg: 2.76inFront chair legs: 1.57inBack chair Legs: 1.2inSeat cushion: 0.8inFinish: Distressed finishAdditional Tools Required: All tools includedPackage Number: 2 Care & Maintenance: - Care should be taken when placing hot items directly on the table. Use a trivet or surface pad when serving heated dishes.- Liquids should be immediately blotted with a damp cloth. Do not use surface cleaners that could remove the finish.- Hardware may loosen over time; periodically check to make sure all connections are tight.- Blot spills immediately with a clean, colorfast towel. Spot clean with a damp cloth or sponge, gently blotting to remove excess water, then air dry. For stains that can't be removed as such, professional cleaning is advised. We recommend periodically fluffing cushions and vacuuming crevices. - To prevent fading, keep fabric out of direct sunlight","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rkTx7r7cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bellemave","source_asin":"B0BL3ZJ7MP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-458568","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL3ZJ7MP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL3ZJ7MP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
