window.products.push({"id":458588,"name":"Clothing Electric Heating Pads 9Pcs, 5V/2A USB Charging 3 Gear Temperature Adjustable Carbon Fiber Heated Sheet Piece, Waterproof Warmer Heating Eleme","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yOp8+40AL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Description: Easy to Carry: The composite fiber has good insulation effect, light weight, and easy to carry, suitable for outdoor camping or other activities in winter. Wide Applications: Perfect to provide heat for your vest, jacket and other clothes. A practical vest warmer to make your life more convenient. Use-friendly: With dual-control switch, you can easy to turn it on to heat both the front and rear areas and keep yourself warm. The front switch controls 2 heating pads, and the rear switch controls 7 heating pads, which can better control the temperature you want. Handy and Washable: USB plug, easy to use, foldable and waterproof, distributes heat evenly, and washable. Uniform and Full: With this Heating Pads, you will never feel cold in the winter. Attention: 1. When using our products, it must be equipped with a power bank or charger with voltage not higher than 7.4V and current not lower than 2A. Otherwise, there will be no heating, no response, etc. 2. When you test the heating pad, cover it with a towel or the like, because the heating pad is directly exposed to the outside and the temperature will dissipate. This product is used to sew to the inner lining of the clothes for heat preservation. Specifications: Product name: Heating Pad Color: Black Pad Material: Composite Fiber Single Pad Size(L x W x H): About 12 x 8cm/ 4.72 x 3.15inch Power supply: USB charging Input voltage: 5V 2A Adjustable temperature: 45℃-65℃ Gear setting: Red (high-range), Blue (mid-range), Green (low-range) Package Includes: 1Pc x 9 in 1 Heating Pad Note: 1. Due to the light and screen difference, the item's color may be slightly different from the pictures. 2. Please allow 0.5-2 cm differences due to manual measurement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yOp8+40AL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WOOPOWER","source_asin":"B09P86CPNQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-458588","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P86CPNQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P86CPNQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":458589,"name":"Mary Lake-Thompson Pug Swimmer Cotton Flour Sack Kitchen Towel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uHj6-AeYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Vintage flour sack towels have remained the cook's favorite kitchen textile for well over a hundred years. They were initially made using salvaged fabric from old flour or grain sacks which were bleached, washed, and trimmed to size. While modern methods have facilitated mass production and beautiful graphics, the practicality of the original flour sack towels remains. Nothing can beat their absorbency, softness, and virtually lint-free performance, making them perfect for drying everything from everyday dishes to crystal stemware. Mary Lake-Thompson studied art at the University of Colorado and the San Francisco Art Institute. She and her husband, Richard, met in the 70s and began a journey that has taken them from selling original prints at local art shows to a nationally recognized brand. Mary Lake-Thompson, Ltd. has designed and produced soaps, aprons, bath products, drawer liners, sachets, napkins, hats, and of course, their signature flour sack towels. The company is located in Oroville, California and now employs about 50 people. Mary's daughter, Sara, continues the tradition through her own, modern take on classic housewares called Montgomery Street Designs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uHj6-AeYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mary Lake-Thompson","source_asin":"B01C3D2ME8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-458589","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01C3D2ME8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01C3D2ME8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
