window.products.push({"id":458595,"name":"BTTN Linen Stall Shower Curtain - 36 x 72 Inches Narrow Textured Fabric Shower Curtain Set with 6 Plastic Hooks, Half Hotel Walk In Modern Simple Eleg","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Py33LxfIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🛁【Farmhouse Style Linen Shower Curtain】: This simple shower curtain features a solid color design that is elegant and classic. A pretty decorative shower curtain can bring a beautiful look to your bathroom, enhance your bathroom taste and let you enjoy a luxurious hotel bath at home. This farmhouse style shower curtain is perfect for apartment, hotel, spa, camper, RV, dorm, school shower, athletic club, gym and everywhere else that needs a shower curtain. 🛁【Premium Quality Textured Linen Blend Fabric】: This linen shower curtain is made of 180GSM premium linen blend woven fabric that is wrinkle free and soft. Featuring an advanced slub weave with subtle embossing and cross-thread texture. This fabric not only retains the organic speckled texture of linen, but is also more skin-friendly than original linen shower curtain. 🛁【Weighted Hem & Water Repellent】: This fabric shower curtain has a weighted hem designed to keep its shape from flying up; the surface has a water repellent coating that promotes the formation of water droplets and allows water to roll off quickly, keeping your bathroom dry and clean. If you want the perfect waterproof effect, We recommended using a liner. 🛁【Dimensions】: W36xH72 inches; Package includes 1 grey/gray shower curtain and 6 plastic hooks; 6 Metal grommets promote easier hanging and long-lasting strength. Fits most standard sized bathrooms and is easy to install. 🛁【Easy Care and After Sale】: Machine washable in cold water and hang to dry. Can be ironed out with a steamer or light iron to smooth out the creases. We are an integrated industry and trade company, dedicated to provide high-quality fabric shower curtains. If there is any quality problem, we will provide a replacement or refund within 60 days from the date of purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Py33LxfIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BTTN","source_asin":"B0BKT1R864","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-458595","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKT1R864","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKT1R864","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
