window.products.push({"id":458599,"name":"Spectrum Diversified Grid Over The Cabinet Towel Bar & Medium Basket, Satin Nickel PC","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mKUvCFrhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Grid Over the Cabinet Towel Bar & Medium Basket from Spectrum Diversified conquers kitchen and bathroom clutter while providing unique cabinet storage solutions. Add extra storage without all the hardware. Padded brackets slide easily over cabinet doors for quick, no fuss installation. No tools required. Perfect for apartments, rental homes, or RVs. The sturdy steel construction withstands kitchen wear and tear and heavy use. The durable metal brackets and towel rack do not bend for stable support of kitchen dish towels and hand towels in the bathroom. Padded foam brackets easily slide over standard cabinet doors without any tools or installation. The towel bar accommodates hand and dish towels while the basket keeps household items up to 10” tall neatly contained. To replace your kitchen towels, simply slide the dirty hand towel off the center rod and slide the replacement washcloth in place. No knobs or arms to adjust. Towel bar fits a variety of hand and dish towels. It’s also perfect for the laundry room. Cross-wire design invites your farmhouse style into your kitchen or bathroom. With clean lines and rustic finishes, the organizer adds a bit of style to your overall design scheme. Cabinet shelves may obstruct cabinet door from properly closing when item is used. Please measure in advance of purchase. Made of sturdy steel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mKUvCFrhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spectrum Diversified","source_asin":"B079XX4DX8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-458599","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079XX4DX8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079XX4DX8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":458600,"name":"Dalykate Extra Large Laundry Basket 115L Collapsible Oxford Fabric Laundry Hamper Foldable Clothes Laundry Bag with Handles Waterproof Washing Portabl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Jpp0k-7bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ALUMIUM HANDLE WITH SOFT GRIP - The lightweight and soft grip handle design of laundry baskets provides comfortable and durable using experience. The aluminum handle and laundry basket are reinforced connected to ensure that it will not tear easily when loading heavy laundry. DOUBLE LAYER 600D OXFORD FABRIC - Crafted from heavy-duty double-layered 600D Oxford fabric with waterproof PE coating inside that thicker than other clothes laundry hampers, this dirty clothes laundry bag with handle can stand steadily and hold the shape even when empty. This laundry hamper bag could protect itself from ripping and splitting under pressure. Washing Tips: WIPE CLEAN ONLY. DIMENSIONS - 17\"(D) x 31\"(H) / 43(D) x 79(H)cm (includes handle), 40% Extra larger than standard size. With 115L Large capacity, our clothes laundry basket is large enough to meet all your needs. The laundry tote bag is easy to carry and long lasting. Whether you need to collect your laundry, tidy your clothes or putting away toys, our spacious foldable laundry hamper is the simplest and most efficient solution. FOLDING TOTE LAUNDRY BAG - Collapsible and versatile feature makes this clothes basket handy and convenient to carry from college apartment to laundromat and practical for easy storage when not in use, folds easily in luggage and drawers without taking up extra space. If it deforms for long time folding, all you have to do is fill it up and leave it for 24h. It will be back in shape! STYLISH DESIGN AND PRATICAL IN USE: Get rid of bulky laundry basket from now on!! This foldable laundry basket is designed for all your storage needs. The portable laundry basket with classic design is suitable for all ages. Perfect for College dorms, Apartments, Hotel stay, Laundromat, Utility room and Shopping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Jpp0k-7bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dalykate","source_asin":"B089CY5S1H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-458600","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089CY5S1H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089CY5S1H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
