window.products.push({"id":458940,"name":"WANGLU Fake Teeth, Cosmetic Denture Veneers for Upper and Lower Jaw, Natural Shade Fake Veneer for Temporary Fix Confident Smile - 2 PCS, White, 1.0 F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+oq5aopfL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get your sunny and confident smile back with our dentures! Features: --Environmentally friendly materials, healthy and safe to use --Natural white tooth coloring, natural gum coloring, mild gloss finish for a realistic look --Thin and comfortable to wear, no foreign body sensation --Readjustable size and reusable after cleaning How to Use: Step 1: Please put an appropriate amount of gutta-percha granules into 90-degree hot water, and let stand in the hot water for about 1-2 minutes, until the gutta-percha becomes transparent. Step 2: Please pick up the transparent teether and put it on the mouthguard mold, pinch the middle with your fingers and pull it to both sides, press down gently, and then put it in hot water again for about 1 minute, you can put it on, be careful not to burn , put it on and press from the middle to the sides for two minutes until a model that fits your teeth is formed. Step 3: Please kindly remove the braces and immediately place in cold water for 1 minute. Once the fitting material cools and hardens and turns white, you can put the teeth back in your mouth. If you are not satisfied with the fit, you can reheat and modify as many times as necessary until you get a secure fit. Warm Tips: 1. The cosmetic teeth are just to help you instantly improve your teeth appearance, Please be careful not to use this product when exercising, smoking, eating, or drinking hot beverages. 2. Do not wear for longer than eight hours at a time. 3. Remove it while sleeping and if you feel any discomfort. 4. Should not be used by children. 5. If you have any questions, please feel to send us an e-mail, we will try our best to meet your request within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+oq5aopfL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WANGLU","source_asin":"B0B7RQMQMY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-458940","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7RQMQMY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7RQMQMY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
