window.products.push({"id":458990,"name":"MELLCOM Recliner Chair, Linen Fabric Recliner with Massage and Heat, Power Lift Chair Electric Recliner Chair for Elderly with Wireless Remote Control","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iPmDSMODL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【8 POINT MASSAGE & LUMBAR HEATING】Our recliner chair is equipped with a wireless remote control. It with 8 Point massage has 3 different vibration intensities and 5 adjustment modes. You can have a full body massage to relax the upper back, lower back, thigh and lumbar. It also has a heating function, which can further promote blood circulation during the massage process. 【HIGH QUALITY MATERIALS】This recliner uses a high-quality metal frame structure that can easily support your body and has a long service life. The padding of high-density soft sponge will bring you great comfort, it can perfectly wrap your body and help you relax your muscles.The breathable linen fabric is waterproof and easy to clean, and has a certain effect of anti-felting and anti-pilling. 【MEET YOUR NEEDS】The lazy boy recliner has many practical functions. You can adjust different inclination angles (105°- 170°) according to your preferences and posture. The 160 degree reclining can provide the best comfort, especially for people after a surgery or with back problems. Extending footrest and reclining feature allows you to fully stretch and relax, such as reading, sleeping, watching TV and so on. 【HUMANIZED DESIGN】The powerful silent single motor design enables the lift chairs recliners for elderly to be adjusting to any position smoothly, it can lay back or tilt to stand which can help the elderly stand up easily. The wide armrests and comfortable headrest and backrest fit your body completely. In addition, this chair is equipped with a wireless remote control (control usage mode). The side pocket design provides a place for placing the remote control and other small objects. 【USING SUGGESTIONS】For your health, if you have pain in a muscle or joint after prolonged use the power recliner chair, please stop using and consult your doctor. Persistent pain may be a symptom of a more serious condition.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iPmDSMODL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MELLCOM","source_asin":"B08PRV1TVW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-458990","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PRV1TVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PRV1TVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":458991,"name":"Waverly Charleston Chirp Valance Rod Pocket Window Curtains for Kitchen or Bathroom, 50\" x 16\", Papaya","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Bz8wpKVnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Charleston Chirp bedding collection is a perfect example of Waverly’s old-world tradition, classic styling, and clean, contemporary fashion. The bedding design features branches of roses, tulips and dianthus, with beautifully placed wrens accented in a gentle pallet of papaya, sage green, orange rust, eggshell blue and lavender on a soft vanilla ground. The all-over nature print is further enhanced by vertical stitched quilting and finished with a coordinating self-piping decorative trim to match the stripe reverse. Versatile, stripe to floral reversible quilt allows you to change your look in seconds for the perfect bedroom retreat. Coordinating reversible shams and vertical stripe bed skirt are included in the quilt set. Quilted shams feature a 3-Inch scalloped flange with stripe accent self-piping. Standard shame measures 21-Inch by 26-Inch. King sham measures 21-Inch by 36-Inch. Bed skirt offers a 15-Inch drop. Coordinating, decorative quilted 20-Inch square pillow sold separately. Complete the look with the coordinating 50-Inch wide valance. 3-Inch Rod pocket window valance fits up to a 2-1/2-Inch decorative rod. Gather two or more scalloped valances on decorative rod for an elegant update to any window. Valances feature stripe self-piping to coordinate back to quilt set. Valance can be hung with solid panels of your choice for a full window ensemble. Quilt set and coordinating accessories are 100-Percent cotton fabric with cotton fill. Valance, decorative quilted pillow and curtain panels sold separately. Imported.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Bz8wpKVnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WAVERLY","source_asin":"B07Y1T4XC9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-458991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y1T4XC9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y1T4XC9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":458992,"name":"Tree-Free Greetings lm43070 Vintage Pacific Flyways Hawaiian Vista by Mike Rangner Ceramic Mug with Full-Sized Handle, 15-Ounce, Multicolored","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hOynwH1cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tree-Free Greetings strives to use the most eco friendly materials and processes possible. Printed and assembled in the USA, the Tree-Free Greetings Ceramic Mug With Full-Sized Handle is vibrantly printed with Vintage Pacific Flyways Hawaiian Vista art and is great for everyday use. It is reusable therefore eliminating disposable paper, plastic or Styrofoam cup waste. This vibrantly printed 15 ounce ceramic mug is BPA Free, Proposition 65 compliant, dishwasher safe and includes a gift box. Mike Rangner's highly sought after art makes a wonderful gift or souvenir. Save trees and spread joy. Buy a Tree-Free earth-friendly gift today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hOynwH1cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tree-Free Greetings","source_asin":"B00A7Q39OQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-458992","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00A7Q39OQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00A7Q39OQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
